                        "review": "NightmareZ - very dynamic platformer in the style of Super Meat Boy, but only with a weapon\nThe game has many levels not similar to each other on the structure, all varied, and for each needs its own approach. The gameplay understandable without any tutorials. We clean the the level of enemies, collect coins along the way, we pass to the next level. At the end of some levels will be bosses. Classic!\n\nGood graphics Done!\nGood music. Done!\nA variety of levels. Done!\nBosses. Done!\nAchievements. Done!\nTrading cards. Done!",
